Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=67}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.95,0:00:11.16,Main-207+,Pirate A,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:13.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like I win again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.74,0:00:16.50,Main-207+,Perona,0,0,0,,Hard at work, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:18.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hand over the keys to the cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.87,0:00:20.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.75,0:00:23.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.84,0:00:28.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.98,0:00:43.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,186)}Seems your manners are as foul\Nas your body odor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:47.03,Main-207+,Pirate B,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.03,0:00:49.90,Main-207+,Pirate A,0,0,0,,You've got a lot of nerves, little lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.41,0:00:55.08,Main-207+,Perona,0,0,0,,I could say the same about you.\NLet's fix that, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.75,0:01:02.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now kneel before me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.92,0:01:05.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.06,0:01:24.98,Main-207+,Pirate B,0,0,0,,I'm not even fit to be a worm\Non a fishing hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:29.47,Main-207+,Pirate A,0,0,0,,I'm gonna crawl into one\Nof these prison cells just to hide my shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.24,0:01:38.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.12,0:01:40.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.68,0:02:03.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not very lively in here, is it? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.02,0:02:07.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.90,0:02:10.01,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.12,0:02:23.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good. Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.25,0:02:31.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.68,0:02:37.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,477)}Wait a second. You're Koby the hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.26,0:02:45.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you'll free Master Moria\Nfrom his cell, deeper inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.56,0:02:47.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Moria?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.64,0:02:51.95,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,Gecko Moria is being held here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.08,0:02:55.45,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,Wait, are you telling me you want\Nme to help a notorious criminal escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.82,0:02:57.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.20,0:02:59.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because if you don't,\Nthen he'll surely be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.83,0:03:07.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How can I set him free?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.01,0:04:43.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We got some big
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.55,0:04:45.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,news! Captain Koby has escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.89,0:04:47.10,Main-207+,Pirate D,0,0,0,,Are you serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.81,0:04:52.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the Commodore can't stop us\Nfrom goin' after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.94,0:04:55.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll be set for life\Nif we can catch him ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.53,0:05:00.99,Main-207+,Pirate F,0,0,0,,{\q2}Then what the hell are we waitin' for? Alright!\NHe's already got a bounty, so we'll be good to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.99,0:05:03.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All we gotta do is take\Nhis head to Cross Guild!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.49,0:05:06.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah. I bought odds\Non him with a Win ticket
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.37,0:05:08.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the payout's gonna be huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.33,0:05:10.33,Main-207+,Pirate J,0,0,0,,How much will we get if we kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.96,0:05:12.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh. You might wanna sit down for this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.00,0:05:16.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His bounty is five stars!\NThat means he's worth
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.75,0:05:20.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,five treasure chests... 500 million berries!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.42,0:05:23.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captains are usually only worth one star!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.05,0:05:25.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They must really want this guy dead, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.10,0:05:31.10,Main-207+,Pirate L,0,0,0,,Alright, men! The hunt is on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.10,0:05:33.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're about to hit the jackpot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.27,0:05:39.32,Main-207+,Pizarro,0,0,0,,I've got an itch on the left side of my chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.65,0:05:42.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's where the slaves are held\Nbefore the sale. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:51.25,Main-207+,Pizarro,0,0,0,,Are you {\i1}kitten{\i0} me? They're escaping!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.58,0:05:53.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The slaves are runnin' for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.94,0:05:56.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! That means\Nwe can hunt 'em down! Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.96,0:05:58.59,Main-207+,Pizarro,0,0,0,,Don't even think a{\i1}meow{\i0}t it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.59,0:06:00.42,Main-207+,Pizarro,0,0,0,,Keep your claws in check!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.97,0:06:02.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring 'em back! Now! And you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.68,0:06:04.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,better not kill Koby!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.59,0:06:06.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or I'll make sure you answer to Teach!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.60,0:06:11.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh. Wait, did that rock just talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.39,0:06:13.52,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,No. Pizarro knows that we're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.52,0:06:14.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.82,0:06:21.65,Main-207+,Prisoner C,0,0,0,,We're not gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.11,0:06:26.66,Main-207+,Prisoner C,0,0,0,,{\q2}Please, Koby, you need to get out of here\Nwhile you still can. Don't let us slow you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.66,0:06:28.87,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,I promised that I'd help you escape,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.87,0:06:31.25,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,and you will, by using me as bait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.75,0:06:35.88,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,Run as fast as you can! And no matter what,\Ndon't let the pirates catch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.88,0:06:36.63,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.63,0:06:39.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll see you all again soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.01,0:06:47.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Captain Koby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.26,0:06:52.60,Main-207+,Prisoner D,0,0,0,,You're a living saint!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.48,0:07:05.88,Main-207+,Shiryu,0,0,0,,Why don't you capture\Nthe damned slaves yourself, Pizarro?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.20,0:07:12.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,567)}'Cause I don't want Teach\Nto come back and chew {\i1}meow{\i0}t.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:19.04,Main-207+,Pizarro,0,0,0,,Whenever I move too much, I end up\Nbreaking things and it's a huge mess. Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.26,0:07:25.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't I stop 'em, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.80,0:07:29.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fur{\i0}get it, Vasco. What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.23,0:07:38.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,485)}If I set the town on fire,\Nthey'll have nowhere to run, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.66,0:07:52.99,Main-207+,Pizarro,0,0,0,,{\q2}That would be a complete {\i1}cat{\i0}-tastrophe! Don't you dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.33,0:07:55.45,Main-207+,Pizarro,0,0,0,,Teach is gonna be {\i1}furry{\i0}-ous!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.45,0:07:58.21,Main-207+,Vasco,0,0,0,,Eh, what's that? Burn 'em, you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.71,0:08:03.30,Main-207+,Pizarro,0,0,0,,Absolutely no burning anyone, you hear me?\NWe just finished repairing Rocky Port!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:07.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, have it your way.\NWe'll let Wolf handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.07,0:08:12.76,Main-207+,Pizarro,0,0,0,,Wait, Wolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:16.98,Main-207+,Pizarro,0,0,5,,That's the worst idea I've ever heard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.98,0:08:19.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He'll crush the whole town into {\i1}kitty litter{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.61,0:08:25.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.84,0:08:33.70,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,Damn it, what am I supposed to do now?\NI can't keep running away forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:37.16,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.21,0:08:43.50,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,{\q2}I just have to hold out until the others can get out of here.\NI'll figure out the rest after that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.88,0:08:47.88,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, well. Koby the Hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.80,0:08:57.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're here, Koby.\N'Cause I've got big plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:09:00.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna turn Pirate Island...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.31,0:09:05.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...into a full-fledged country!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.15,0:09:09.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One that flies the flag\Nof the World Government!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.61,0:09:12.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that'll make me a king
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.66,0:09:14.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of the Blackbeard Kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.16,0:09:20.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what d'you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.12,0:09:22.21,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,I think your plan's as ridiculous as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.58,0:09:24.71,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,You really think the Government\Nwould agree to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.13,0:09:27.17,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,To a country made up of criminals?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.55,0:09:31.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't you know it's rude\Nto stomp on someone's dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.55,0:09:35.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They might see it my way,\Nnow I've got you as a bargaining chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.85,0:09:40.60,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,The day the Navy negotiates\Nwith terrorists will be the day justice dies!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.44,0:09:43.94,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,And I won't be your bargaining chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.81,0:09:45.86,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,I can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.57,0:09:48.53,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,I'm a member of SWORD!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.78,0:09:51.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? The hell is SWORD?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.61,0:09:53.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Never heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.32,0:09:54.87,Main-207+,Aokiji,0,0,0,,So that's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.87,0:09:55.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.57,0:09:57.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This will not end well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.58,0:09:59.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Call off the trade, Teach. It won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.34,0:10:02.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.59,0:10:09.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since this kid's from SWORD,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.13,0:10:12.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that means he's a Marine, but not officially.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.47,0:10:15.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,SWORD members surrender their Navy Code.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.14,0:10:23.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}They aren't like their comrades.\NThey're Marines who have submitted their resignations.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.10,0:10:27.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They can pick fights with the Four Emperors\Nwithout permission from above.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.27,0:10:31.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They can also disregard orders\Nat their discretion and move as they like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.32,0:10:34.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that's the issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.03,0:10:39.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Navy is absolved\Nof all responsibility for their actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.49,0:10:43.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They can cut them loose as they see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.21,0:10:46.58,Main-207+,Teach,0,0,0,,Ain't that cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.08,0:10:50.84,Main-207+,Teach,0,0,0,,Most Marines just sit on their asses,\Nwaiting for daddy's permission to fight us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.26,0:10:54.68,Main-207+,Teach,0,0,0,,But you do what you like,\Nconsequences be damned!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.33,0:10:59.81,Main-207+,Teach,0,0,0,,I get it now! I like your style!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.10,0:11:02.14,Main-207+,Teach,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.14,0:11:04.77,Main-207+,Teach,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna change my plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.35,0:11:07.89,Main-207+,Teach,0,0,0,,'Cause you're a special case!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.36,0:11:10.57,Main-207+,Teach,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter if you're with SWORD or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.28,0:11:14.82,Main-207+,Teach,0,0,0,,The public won't like it\Nif the Navy abandons you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.82,0:11:18.24,Main-207+,Teach,0,0,0,,{\q2}It's bad press to turn your back on a hero, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.03,0:11:21.49,Main-207+,Teach,0,0,0,,Your life's in the people's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.62,0:11:25.66,Main-207+,Teach,0,0,0,,Looks like the World Government\Nwill lose credibility either way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:32.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think he gets the message. We're done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.17,0:11:35.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lock him up
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.01,0:11:37.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,2022)}and don't let him escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.47,0:11:42.31,Main-207+,Pirate R,0,0,0,,Get back here, Koby!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.92,0:11:49.36,Flashbacks-207+,Perona,0,0,0,,Here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.36,0:11:55.65,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(5816,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}I'll unlock this door for you, and in return,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.65,0:11:58.45,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,Guess this is what I deserve\Nfor helping a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.95,0:12:01.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But necessity knows no law!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.87,0:12:09.79,Main-207+,Pirate S,0,0,0,,The hell's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.43,0:12:07.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.47,0:12:22.18,Main-207+,Pirate T,0,0,0,,Three Marines just showed up at the port!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.68,0:12:25.22,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,Huh? Marines? That can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.85,0:12:27.18,Main-207+,Pirate U,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.23,0:12:30.81,Main-207+,Pirate V,0,0,0,,They're strong! Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.61,0:12:34.73,Thoughts-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,Did someone come to rescue me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.73,0:12:36.07,Thoughts-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,No, stop it, Koby, this
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.07,0:12:37.74,Thoughts-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,is not the time for your selfishness!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.74,0:12:38.95,Thoughts-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,What is wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.63,0:12:59.76,Main-207+,Pirate Ab,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.76,0:13:01.26,Main-207+,Pirate Ab,0,0,0,,They're monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.26,0:13:03.76,Main-207+,Pirate Ac,0,0,0,,Looks like they're headed straight\Nto the center of town!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.76,0:13:04.72,Main-207+,Pirate Ac,0,0,0,,What do they want from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.72,0:13:07.14,Main-207+,Pirate Ac,0,0,0,,I don't know! Just shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.73,0:13:15.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.73,0:13:17.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They didn't even flinch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.65,0:13:20.99,Main-207+,Pirate Ad,0,0,0,,End of the line, monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.57,0:13:25.99,Main-207+,Pirate Ae,0,0,0,,Whoa! His head came off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.52,0:13:32.21,Main-207+,Pirate Ad,0,0,0,,Woohoo! Y'see that? That's how it's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.54,0:13:33.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're not so tough now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.51,0:13:41.80,Main-207+,Marine Golem A,0,0,0,,That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.80,0:13:43.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? He's a logia-type!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.26,0:13:45.80,Main-207+,Pirate Ad,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.80,0:13:48.10,Main-207+,Pirate Ad,0,0,0,,His body's like clay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.64,0:13:52.02,Main-207+,Pirate F,0,0,0,,Where are you, Koby?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.23,0:13:55.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.36,0:13:58.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I swear I just saw\Nthose buildings move on their own!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.73,0:14:00.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure they did, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.49,0:14:02.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How's quitting drinking going for ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.79,0:14:12.96,Main-207+,Kujaku,0,0,0,,Be good and do as I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.38,0:14:17.13,Main-207+,Kujaku,0,0,0,,Now march forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.13,0:14:20.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is she whipping that building? That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.09,0:14:22.88,Main-207+,Kujaku,0,0,0,,Come on. Where's your stamina?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.18,0:14:27.51,Main-207+,Kujaku,0,0,0,,Is that really the best you can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.51,0:14:29.64,Main-207+,Kujaku,0,0,0,,You are so pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.64,0:14:32.14,Main-207+,Pirate Aj,0,0,0,,I kinda feel like we shouldn't be watching this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.35,0:14:35.56,Main-207+,Kujaku,0,0,0,,Hi, boys. Finished staring?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.56,0:14:37.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh! We, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.82,0:14:39.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, that mark!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.74,0:14:50.41,Main-207+,Kujaku,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,476)}You pirates act like\Nyou've never seen a Marine before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.41,0:14:55.67,Main-207+,Kujaku,0,0,0,,How adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.67,0:14:57.17,Main-207+,Kujaku,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.76,0:15:06.64,Main-207+,Kujaku,0,0,0,,Let me teach you a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.48,0:15:18.61,Thoughts-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,What now? I'm done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.25,0:15:25.28,Main-207+,Pirate Al,0,0,0,,Eyes on the target, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.99,0:15:30.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ready. Aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.70,0:15:33.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.01,0:15:45.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.35,0:15:56.44,Main-207+,Pirate C,0,0,0,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.44,0:15:57.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.17,0:16:02.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, my! How lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.98,0:16:04.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.07,0:16:05.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:08.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Where are these goddamn flowers coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.45,0:16:11.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, I've seen this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.70,0:16:12.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.53,0:16:18.17,Main-207+,Pirate D,0,0,0,,Dr. Vegapunk invented this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.59,0:16:25.71,Main-207+,Pirate D,0,0,0,,In fact, it earned him the Mobel Peace Prize!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.76,0:16:28.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nobody cares about that, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.47,0:16:31.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell did this to our guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.80,0:16:33.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Koby!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.43,0:16:38.44,Main-207+,Hibari,0,0,0,,Come here and stay close to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.77,0:16:41.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh. Uh. But not in a weird way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.32,0:16:48.11,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,Wait, Hibari? What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.65,0:16:49.74,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,Are those...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.74,0:16:50.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.86,0:16:54.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're Flower Rounds.\NBut they won't last; we have to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.79,0:16:56.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need to go before the enemy's gunpowder
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.95,0:16:58.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,stops turning into flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.37,0:17:01.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Also... I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.79,0:17:03.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't want your food to get cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.00,0:17:05.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.63,0:17:08.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I packed you a lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.01,0:17:09.09,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.09,0:17:12.36,Main-207+,Hibari,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,107)}Ah! No, I misspoke!\NI mean, you misheard me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.62,0:17:20.56,Main-207+,Tashigi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Prince! What's the status?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.21,0:17:24.77,Main-207+,Grus,0,0,0,,We're in the clear.\NEverything went off without a hitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.20,0:17:34.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1}Koby's doing fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.49,0:17:40.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec. This place\Ndoesn't look right. Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.96,0:17:41.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.15,0:17:47.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Everyone, look!\NThat building just moved!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.30,0:17:48.76,Main-207+,Pirate G,0,0,0,,No! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.09,0:17:53.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.80,0:17:55.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They moved the buildings\Nand trapped us here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.89,0:17:57.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whenever you're ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.27,0:17:59.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aim for the dead center!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.23,0:18:02.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just got confirmation from Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.52,0:18:03.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone is in position!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.94,0:18:06.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're ready, Vice Admiral!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.90,0:18:09.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone! Hang on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.03,0:18:14.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To hell we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.62,0:18:23.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.37,0:18:26.21,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,Alright! If you're ready, I am, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.99,0:18:29.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.96,0:18:33.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not stickin' around to find out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.44,0:18:51.32,Main-207+,Pirate K,0,0,0,,There's an alien ship in the sky!\NIt's flying straight for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.32,0:18:53.99,Main-207+,Pirate L,0,0,0,,But why? And how?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.99,0:18:55.32,Main-207+,Pirate M,0,0,0,,Whose ship is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.78,0:18:59.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh... Looks like it's falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.70,0:19:02.25,Main-207+,Pirate O,0,0,0,,We gotta go! Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.96,0:19:07.08,Main-207+,Pirate P,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.08,0:19:08.59,Main-207+,Pirate P,0,0,0,,I know that ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.38,0:19:14.84,Main-207+,Pirate Q,0,0,0,,No. That can't be right! I thought he retired!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.34,0:19:16.80,Main-207+,Pirate R,0,0,0,,The legendary hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.80,0:19:18.39,Main-207+,Pirate R,0,0,0,,He's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.90,0:19:26.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Vice Admiral Garp!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.98,0:19:28.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Koby!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.48,0:19:30.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Koby! I came to get ya, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.23,0:19:34.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on! We have to take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.99,0:19:35.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're trapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.95,0:19:37.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.49,0:19:45.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! You wanna piece of me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.87,0:19:48.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh! Oh, shit! – He's coming for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.89,0:20:08.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not worth any of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.81,0:20:12.90,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,You would risk starting a war\Njust to protect me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.32,0:20:14.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.61,0:20:20.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you kidnapped?\NDo you know who that kid is?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.96,0:20:32.17,Main-207+,Garp,0,0,0,,Koby's not just the future of the Navy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.34,0:20:35.96,Main-207+,Garp,0,0,0,,That boy
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.42,0:20:40.55,Main-207+,Garp,0,0,0,,is my favorite student!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.93,0:20:45.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Galaxy...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.40,0:21:00.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Impact!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.60,0:22:16.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My back! Damn Garp!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.61,0:22:18.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.19,0:22:20.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where'd ya go? You're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.44,0:22:22.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, pirates! Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.11,0:22:26.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got plenty more firepower.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.87,0:22:36.38,Main-207+,Garp,0,0,0,,Still a few buildings left.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.17,0:22:39.17,Main-207+,Garp,0,0,0,,I must be losin' my touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.80,0:22:41.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Losing your touch"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.17,0:22:43.80,Main-207+,Pirate Ab,0,0,0,,Quit rubbin' it in, you old bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.18,0:22:46.96,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,– Vice Admiral Garp!\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.22,0:22:49.47,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,Hey! There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.14,0:22:51.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You alright, Koby?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.14,0:22:56.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.02,0:22:58.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought my buddy was gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.40,0:23:00.03,Main-207+,Kujaku,0,0,0,,And once again,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.03,0:23:01.53,Main-207+,Kujaku,0,0,0,,Garp overdid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.53,0:23:04.40,Main-207+,Kujaku,0,0,0,,Such a naughty boy, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.40,0:23:08.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he said\NKoby is the future of the Navy. As if.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.37,0:23:10.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll put that kid in his place!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.58,0:23:16.08,Main-207+,Kujaku,0,0,0,,{\q2}I know you're too spoiled to know better,\Nbut that's not the sort of thing you should say out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.71,0:23:18.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Koby!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.79,0:23:21.09,Main-207+,Marine B,0,0,0,,Captain Koby!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.42,0:23:23.55,Main-207+,Tashigi,0,0,0,,Koby!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.55,0:23:25.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tashigi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.63,0:23:28.01,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,Even people who are from SWORD are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.14,0:23:32.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? What have you got there?\NA big ball and chain?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.10,0:23:33.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.85,0:23:37.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,had no choice but to take it with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.52,0:23:38.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't there...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.86,0:23:42.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.78,0:23:44.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we can...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:52.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hibari!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.08,0:23:53.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.67,0:23:57.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's frozen solid?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.01,0:24:11.26,Main-207+,Garp,0,0,0,,Kuzan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.76,0:24:13.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, Kuzan?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.56,0:24:14.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.98,0:24:17.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unfreeze Hibari right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.52,0:24:21.06,Main-207+,Pirate Ac,0,0,0,,Woohoo! Hell yeah, it's Aokiji!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.69,0:24:24.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys are dead now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.19,0:24:26.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, Kuzan!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.40,0:24:29.28,Main-207+,Aokiji,0,0,0,,Don't get me in trouble, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.28,0:24:31.20,Main-207+,Aokiji,0,0,0,,Can't have you getting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.62,0:24:34.33,Main-207+,Aokiji,0,0,0,,How would that look to Teach?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.04,0:24:40.83,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\q2}Two years ago, there was a struggle to determine\Nwho would be the next Fleet Admiral at Navy Headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.42,0:24:47.51,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,To that end, Admiral Akainu\Nand Admiral Aokiji had a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.94,0:24:56.02,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,The fight went on for ten days\Nbefore a victor was decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.68,0:24:57.73,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Akainu stood
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.44,0:25:04.40,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,Regardless, Aokiji refused\Nto serve under Akainu as Fleet Admiral,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.40,0:25:08.11,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,and so, he resigned.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.30,0:25:28.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.72,0:25:30.51,Main-207+,Townsperson A,0,0,0,,Blackbeard is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.51,0:25:33.30,Main-207+,Townsperson B,0,0,0,,Run! Get outta town while you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.30,0:25:34.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.22,0:25:36.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is this? What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.43,0:25:39.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop! Someone tell me who did this!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.52,0:25:46.67,Main-207+,Teach,0,0,0,,Wait, I know what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.32,0:25:52.74,Main-207+,Teach,0,0,0,,I don't even gotta ask. There's only one guy\Nin the world who could pull this off!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.70,0:25:56.16,Main-207+,Teach,0,0,0,,I thought so!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.16,0:25:58.20,Main-207+,Teach,0,0,0,,Aokiji!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.80,0:26:13.43,Main-207+,Teach,0,0,0,,What's the big idea, turnin'\Nmy crew into ice cubes?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.43,0:26:15.85,Main-207+,Teach,0,0,0,,Fix it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.72,0:26:19.31,Main-207+,Aokiji,0,0,0,,Why don't you fix your attitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.31,0:26:22.94,Main-207+,Aokiji,0,0,0,,Wouldn't do that if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.44,0:26:26.73,Main-207+,Aokiji,0,0,0,,Your friends'll shatter and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.23,0:26:31.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, now. You think I started this fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.74,0:26:35.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know what kind of company you keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.95,0:26:38.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Also, I'm sure you heard the news about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.66,0:26:43.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm in a state of mourning.\NYou shouldn't test me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.88,0:26:48.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So let's cool it with the demands, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.61,0:27:15.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's ready for more?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.78,0:27:19.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.87,0:27:22.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not so bad yourself, shitbag!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.08,0:27:29.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, before the battle,\Nwhat does Akainu say?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.84,0:27:34.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"We climbed the ranks together,\Nnow we fight to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.97,0:27:38.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to feel a hot lump in my throat."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.89,0:27:41.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's what he said.\NAnd you know what I told him?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.22,0:27:44.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"No shit, asshole, you're made of magma!"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.10,0:27:49.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look what that bastard did!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.53,0:27:54.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Took off my whole damn leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.40,0:27:58.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that's what happens when two admirals\Ndecide to throw down, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.36,0:27:59.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So'd you pay him back, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.45,0:28:02.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rip off one of his arms, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.20,0:28:04.20,Main-207+,Aokiji,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.92,0:28:09.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But he's got some scars to remember me by.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.13,0:28:16.47,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,That reminds me, Commodore.\NHe might know the Man with the Burn Scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.84,0:28:18.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The what? Who the hell's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.97,0:28:24.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The deal is, if we wanna make it to Laugh Tale,\NWe gotta find the four Road Poneglyphs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.89,0:28:32.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ys know 'em when you see 'em, 'cause they're\Nbright red. Kaido and Big Mom have one each.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.19,0:28:37.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But what about the other two?\NThey're still a mystery!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.53,0:28:40.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're just hoping fate will guide us to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.28,0:28:41.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.24,0:28:47.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, we do have one tiny lead. We heard\Nsome man with a burn scar has one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.96,0:28:50.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mean me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.12,0:28:52.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, not you! You just got that the other day!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.17,0:28:59.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quite the mystery, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.47,0:29:10.31,Main-207+,Lafitte,0,0,0,,Rumor has it that the Man\Nwith the Burn Scar sails on a pitch-black ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.28,0:29:24.70,Main-207+,Lafitte,0,0,0,,{\q2}But if anyone approaches it, their ship will be whisked away,\Nswallowed up by a giant whirlpool.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.79,0:29:30.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd assume the fellow has a devil fruit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.12,0:29:34.71,Main-207+,Shiryu,0,0,0,,Just a hunch, but I bet\Nthe guy is with the Government.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.21,0:29:38.76,Main-207+,Shiryu,0,0,0,,They've got their hands in everything,\Nand plenty of dark secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.76,0:29:41.63,Main-207+,Shiryu,0,0,0,,They know everyone needs those stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.63,0:29:44.98,Main-207+,Shiryu,0,0,0,,If they had one, all they'd have\Nto do is hold on to it
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.98,0:29:50.84,Main-207+,Shiryu,0,0,0,,and we'd be sunk. No pirate could find\Ntheir way to Laugh Tale or the One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.69,0:29:55.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Poneglyphs, huh? Brings back memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.57,0:30:01.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hate to break it to ya, but I never saw\Na giant red stone in Ohara. I'd remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.86,0:30:04.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I haven't forgotten a thing about that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.99,0:30:08.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The day I watched my best friend rebel\Nagainst the Government.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.24,0:30:11.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the day that I saw those sad eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.58,0:30:15.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}When I held that poor, lonely girl's fate in my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.67,0:30:20.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? That story sounds boring as all hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.38,0:30:25.60,Main-207+,Lafitte,0,0,0,,Commodore, what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.60,0:30:30.93,Main-207+,Lafitte,0,0,0,,A power like his could be quite useful.\NI say we take it while his guard's down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.40,0:30:39.36,Main-207+,Aokiji,0,0,0,,I heard that, you conniving bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.57,0:30:45.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, then! You wanna know\Nwhat it feels like to freeze to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.08,0:30:50.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.00,0:30:58.47,Main-207+,Aokiji,0,0,0,,So the rumors are true. You're hunting people\Nwith strong devil fruit powers, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.21,0:31:02.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then try to take mine! I dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.59,0:31:07.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.68,0:31:09.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.93,0:31:12.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My crew members were getting\Ncarried away, that's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.31,0:31:15.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me apologize on their behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.85,0:31:17.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna steal your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.98,0:31:20.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want you to join my crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.40,0:31:24.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts? An ex-Marine?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.65,0:31:27.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why not? You're out of a job now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.62,0:31:29.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got any place to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.62,0:31:31.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anything you're planning to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.62,0:31:34.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not gonna be defending justice anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.08,0:31:37.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha! Guess I've sunk pretty low, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.21,0:31:41.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A good-for-nothing pirate's worried\Nabout the state of my employment.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.09,0:31:44.30,Main-207+,Teach,0,0,0,,Men like us will find trouble anywhere we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.92,0:31:48.05,Main-207+,Teach,0,0,0,,Can't run, so you might\Nas well face it head-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.05,0:31:53.22,Main-207+,Teach,0,0,0,,{\q2}What flag will you fly? When you put your life on the line,\Nwhat will you be fighting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.22,0:31:54.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.02,0:31:59.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got my own brand\Nof justice, my own code!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.02,0:32:01.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This won't be nothing\Nlike the Navy, I promise you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.86,0:32:03.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.19,0:32:08.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But I'll still get stabbed straight in the back!\NYou think sharin' a couple of drinks means I can trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.20,0:32:09.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.57,0:32:12.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't think you understand\Nhow pirates work!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.45,0:32:16.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not here to make friends!\NWe're a crew, but we're not buddy-buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.63,0:32:23.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We all have a common goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.51,0:32:30.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All pirates need is an alignment of interests!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.56,0:32:36.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're free now, Kuzan. Your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.19,0:32:40.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you really want?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.66,0:32:56.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop this, Kuzan!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.75,0:32:58.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thaw Hibari out right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.12,0:33:00.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let Koby escape from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.92,0:33:03.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back to the Navy!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.38,0:33:11.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y'never change, huh? Can't stop to think.\NYou just run your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.22,0:33:19.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid I can't help you today, Garp!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.23,0:33:22.02,Main-207+,Aokiji,0,0,0,,You've always been straightforward.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.90,0:33:24.73,Main-207+,Aokiji,0,0,0,,I admire that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.36,0:33:29.65,Main-207+,Aokiji,0,0,0,,You inspired me. So I'm livin'\Nthe way {\i1}I{\i0} want to now!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.87,0:33:36.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You damn fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.97,0:33:54.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}Ice Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.77,0:34:03.73,Main-207+,Coby,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Garp!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.90,0:34:07.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.20,0:34:13.82,Main-207+,Aokiji,0,0,0,,Your old student and your new student...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.41,0:34:18.91,Main-207+,Aokiji,0,0,0,,Would you do anything\Nto save Koby, even if it kills me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.62,0:34:23.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh. What are you doing,\Nbringing up the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.46,0:34:27.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I taught you to live in the moment, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.00,0:34:34.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How the hell did he break free?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.41,0:34:56.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here's another lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.35,0:35:21.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Men who waver...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.31,0:35:25.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...are weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.48,0:35:29.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Come on! Blue Hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.89,0:36:02.60,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,On the coast of Winter Island...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.39,0:36:44.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Now that your ship is out of the picture,\Nyou haven't just lost your right to call yourself a pirate,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.77,0:36:47.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you've lost your only escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.10,0:36:54.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You stole 100 hearts that day at Rocky Port.\NYou had to expect some kinda payback from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.36,0:36:58.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those poor pirates back at my base, living\Nevery damn day in fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.32,0:37:05.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}So I think I'll bring them back {\i1}your{\i0} heart as a gift!\NBet that'll have the sad bastards jumpin' for joy!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.42,0:37:14.67,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, you made this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.67,0:37:18.63,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(3479,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}But I haven't been able to test it,\Nso I can't guarantee it'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.39,0:37:26.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me think.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.02,0:37:30.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We could sell your Fruit,\Nbut I think I could put it to better use.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.39,0:37:33.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They say it can grant\Nsomeone eternal life, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.24,0:37:48.68,Main-207+,Bepo,0,0,0,,That's my captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.72,0:38:06.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.85,0:38:09.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sulong? But how? The moon isn't even out!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.03,0:39:02.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it! They're headed to the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.32,0:39:04.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get them, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.50,0:39:14.08,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,Take me back, Bepo.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.54,0:39:22.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're my friends. I can't leave them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.84,0:39:24.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.78,0:39:27.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't risk it! But your crew was
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.72,0:39:30.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,forged in the cold waters of the north!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.52,0:39:35.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have faith in them! Through every fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.90,0:39:37.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they've held strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.48,0:39:40.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They won't die here!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.74,0:39:49.49,Main-207+,Bepo,0,0,0,,We've overcome so much together!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.58,0:39:53.45,Main-207+,Bepo,0,0,0,,We have to survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.54,0:39:57.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.88,0:40:07.47,Thoughts-207+,Bepo,0,0,0,,Don't die, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.84,0:40:10.85,Thoughts-207+,Bepo,0,0,0,,We need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.93,0:40:20.83,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,The battle at Winner Island,\Nin the New World, came to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.32,0:40:33.41,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,Blackbeard destroyed the {\i0}Polar Tang{\i1},\Nthe submarine of the Heart Pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.41,0:40:36.48,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,and it sank into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.37,0:40:43.26,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,The Heart Pirates, led by Trafalgar Law,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.75,0:40:45.26,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,were defeated.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=68}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=69}============================SIGNS AND TITLE=========================
